# k.actions/shards/verbs-place: 33 verbs and phrasal verbs that mean the act "place" (place, put, set, lay, position, move, shift, relocate ...): the WordNet senses read for it, the role of the object, what the verb itself says, and the prepositions that mark a role after this verb.
